world. How did the conversation go and what did your daughter tell you? Yeah, so we were on a walk, and we were, you know, just having a regular conversation about the state of the world, as you do with your 12-year-old. And she was just really dogging on humans. And it felt a little bit like she was parroting what she had heard elsewhere, or maybe

