of Zen meditation mode visualizing with them with their eyes all closed and I asked them, okay, slowly open your eyes and come back and share what that world was like, you know, thinking it would be this utopic, cathartic experience for all of us. But they basically said there was, first of all, there was a lot of silence and crickets, and then all of a sudden it was like, Sarah, we couldn't really visualize that future.

