okay, you all have come in, you're really idealistic. How are we gonna move from idealism through all of these grief emotions, anxiety emotions, anxiety emotions, despair emotions about how bad things are? How do we really sit with how bad things are? And then move into something more like action or some kind of catharsis where we work together, collective efficacy.

