Yes, and I thought to myself, I can't lift this group up. I can't do this. This is hopeless. I can't do what I've. I can't do this. This is hopeless. I can't do what I've been put on this planet to do as a teacher. The problems really are the way he described. Like many people in the throes of despair, Sarah looked for quick ways to make herself feel better. Some of these things helped, at least in the throes of despair, Sarah looked for quick ways to make herself feel better.

